## 3. ReduceFieldsSystem Behavior Audit

`ReduceFieldsSystem.Execute` (line 47-101):
1. Groups by (Field via perField dict, Subject, Tick via GroupKey) — matches plan.
2. Catalog lookup via `_catalog.TryGet(fieldId, ...)` (line 80); reducer lookup via `_reducers.TryGet(descriptor.Reducer, ...)` (line 82).
3. Canonical sort: `list.Sort(CompareCanonically)` (line 89); `CompareCanonically` = (Tick asc, ProducerId ordinal) (line 104-109).
4. Reduce: `reducer.Reduce(descriptor, list)` (line 90).
5. Write resolved: `resolved.ByField[fieldId] = resolvedValue` (line 95); latest tick wins (line 91).
6. Clear buffer: `contributions.Clear()` (line 99).
All six plan-required behaviors present.

